title: Foreign Policy
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; foreign_policy_timer += 8
view-if: kcp_in_government = 1 and foreign_minister_party = "KCP" and  foreign_policy_timer <= 0
card-image: img/kcp_foreign_affairs.png
go-to: fp_menu
#subtitle: International relations

= Foreign Policy

What should our foreign policy priority be?

@fp_menu

- @improve_west
- @improve_east
- @improve_soviet
- @customs_union
- @negotiate
- @reduce_reparations
- @european_union
- @european_union_2
- @root: Do not enact any policies for now.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@improve_west
title: Improve our relations with the hosts of the Alteran Conference - Amar.
on-arrival: west_relation += 2; reparations_negotiation += 1

The key to the conference of Altera is the Amarian leader Buzzy to whom we owe a sum of money since the Elro crisis.

@improve_east
title: Try to rebuild relations with the nation of Zephyr.
on-arrival: austria_relation += 2; sdapo_strength += 1;

We have for long had bad relations with Zephyr but perhaps that could change , they also provide aid to build up organization of our paramilitary troops.


@improve_soviet
title: Improve our relations with Zilatra.
subtitle: We could also broach the question of the UP...

The Zilatrans are not our natural allies due to our ideaological diffirences but they do posses contacts among leftits and Kaddu and it may be worth building these relations as a way to perhaps influence our own leftists.
They could also be a vital counterbalance to Sentaran dominance.

- @soviet_economic_aid_yes_mil: Provide military aid in exchange for joint military training.
- @soviet_economic_aid_no: Don't provide aid.

@soviet_economic_aid_yes_mil
choose-if: budget >= 1
subtitle: -1 budget
on-arrival: budget -= 1; soviet_relation += 1; reichswehr_militancy += 0.2; reichswehr_loyalty += 0.05;

The Zilatrans are pleased for all of the military aid they can get and help train our troops.

- @kpd: Ask if Gaszalasi could help repair our relations with the UP.
- @root: Do not mention the UP.

@soviet_economic_aid_no

The Zilatrans are slightly upset, but they seemed to expect this answer.


@kpd
on-arrival: up_relation += 8*(1-dissent);

We also mention the UP in our conversations with the foreign commisar. They claim that the Unitarists are independent party without any way for Zilatra to influence them however they promise to put a good word for us.

@customs_union
title: Form a economic union with Sentara?
subtitle: This will likely incur the wrath of Zephyr.
unavailable-subtitle: This is superseded by the Alteran Union.
choose-if: eu = 0
view-if: black_thursday_seen = 1 and customs_union = 0

The Sentaran supporting forces in our goverment have for long clambered for a economic union with Sentara. Now we are able to do it. This will however anger Zephyr which will see us as picking a side in the ongoing cold war.

- @customs_union_2: Yes, do it!
- @fp_menu: No, we should do something else.

@customs_union_2
on-arrival: customs_union = 1; austria_relation -= 2; up_relation -= 6; vnpf_relation -= 6; strife += 1; workers_kcp -= 10;
max-visits: 1

We have formed a economic union with the nation of Sentara! This has been the culmination of a long time effort by some to tie us closer to Sentara. However this also damages our reputation at home and radicalizes our opposition.


@negotiate
title: Slowly pay back and negotiate down the debt we owe to Amar.
subtitle: We owe quite a lot of money after the Elro crisis.
view-if: reparations > -2 and reparations_negotiation < 3
on-arrival: west_relation += 1; reparations_negotiation += 1; reparations_negotiation += 1 if pacifism >= 3; reparations_negotiations += 1 if nationalism <= 50; reparations_negotiation += 1 if west_relation >= 3

Negotiations and the paying back proceeds smoothly for the most part. [? if nationalism <= 50 or pacifism >= 3 : Buzzy is happy to see Kaddu renounce militarism which while not dangerous for neighboring nations has often brought chaos to Kaddu itself. ?]


@reduce_reparations
title: Amar is finaly happy with our reperations payments!
subtitle: Our negotiations have been successful.
view-if: reparations_negotiation >= 3 and black_thursday_seen == 1 and reparations > -2
on-arrival: west_relation += 1; reparations = -2; old_middle_kcp += 5*(1-dissent); new_middle_kcp += 5*(1-dissent); rural_kcp += 5*(1-dissent); economic_growth += 0.7; economic_growth += 0.5 if economic_growth < 0
max-visits: 1

Finally we have been able to break ourselves free of the crushing debt and even bolstered our friendship with Amar in the process.

@european_union
title: Take steps to form a "Alteran Union".
subtitle: Is it even possible?
unavailable-subtitle: [? if west_relation < 5 : Our relations with Amar are not good enough. ?] [? if east_relation < 4 : Our relations with Sentara are not good enough. ?] [? if austria_relation < 4 : Our relations with Zephyr are not good enough. ?]
view-if: reparations <= -2 and eu_progress < 2 and eu = 0
choose-if: west_relation >= 5 and east_relation >= 4 and austria_relation >= 4 
on-arrival: eu_progress += 1; west_relation += 1

Forming a Union of Alteran nations has been a long dream of many. However for the longest time our continent has been plagued by cold wars , intrigue , espionage and paranoia. Now we are trying to rise above it and empower the conference to a stronger position to establish long lasting peace and harmony on Altera.

@european_union_2
title: We can sign a treaty to form a Alteran Union!
view-if: west_relation >= 5 and east_relation >= 4 and eu_progress >= 2 and eu = 0 and austria_relation >= 4
on-arrival: eu = 1; unemployed -= 2 if unemployed >= 10; inflation += 2 if inflation <= -2; inflation -= 1 if inflation >= 4.5; workers_kcp += 5*(1-dissent); new_middle_kcp += 5*(1-dissent); old_middle_kcp += 5*(1-dissent); rural_kcp += 4*(1-dissent); catholics_kcp += 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_kcp += 4*(1-dissent); pro_republic += 5; nationalism -= 5; budget += 1; economic_growth += 1; economic_growth += 1 if economic_growth < 3
max-visits: 1

Together with the nations of Amar , Sentara and Zephyr we are able to forge a Alteran Union. Some said it was impossible to do. However now it is reality and a sense of euphoria floods the continent. The cold wars and paranoia seem to be a thing of the past now as goods and citizens are free to go where they please and our national goverments vow to protect each other and cooperate on united goals for the continent.
